# Build context for the arcade image only. BuildKit prefers a
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the repo-root `.dockerignore`, so this file
# REPLACES that one for `sdk/examples/arcade/Dockerfile` — it has to repeat
# the entries that matter here rather than extend them.
#
# The arcade build needs `orval.config.ts`, `openapi/openapi.public.json`,
# `sdk/client`, and `sdk/examples/arcade`, and nothing else in the repository.
# The root file deliberately keeps `.git` in the context so the app image can
# replay turbo's git-hashed cache; this build runs neither, and .git is by far
# the largest thing in the tree.
.git

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Written locally by `pnpm install`; the sdk-client stage regenerates them.
sdk/client/src/generated
sdk/client/src/react
ui/src/client/generated-internal

# The local PGLite data dir and its backups: player rows and Reflex API keys.
sdk/examples/arcade/.data
sdk/examples/arcade/.data.backups
sdk/examples/arcade/shots
